rofile","importance":4,"always_on":false,"source":"said"},{"id":"@r455b157d52","text":"Prefers direct, blunt, exact numeric answers without fluffy wording.","kind":"response_style","importance":3,"always_on":false,"source":"said"},{"id":"@r8f127f3e27","text":"Has an upcoming trip to Baguio.","kind":"event","tags":["trip","baguio"],"importance":3,"always_on":false,"source":"said"},{"id":"@r9a739eccde","text":"Training goal: build/maintain muscle while weightlifting and lower body fat from 20% to 15%, with an optimized diet.","kind":"goal","tags":["fitness","diet","muscle","body fat"],"importance":4,"always_on":false,"source":"said"},{"id":"@r6dc72ea082","text":"When a reply has finished acting, never end with a promise of a future action (\"I'll note what to push\") — a reply ends the turn and nothing else runs.","kind":"response_style","importance":5,"always_on":false,"source":"said"}]},"turn":[{"text":"[1 photo attached. What they show (read by 3 readers; label numbers are the ones at least two read alike):\nPhoto 1 — meal: Hand holding a dark-purple bar coated in shredded coconut, over a clear container of more of the same bars.\nFoods: purple coconut bar (shredded coconut over a purple grain/rice base) about 40 g.\nHard to read: exact identity of the purple base (black/purple rice, taro, or ube); exact weight per roll; how many bars are being eaten (held piece vs. the rest in the container); whether filling or syrup is inside the rolls.]","at":"2026-11-01T22:02:18+08:00"}],"expect":{"tools_any":[["log_meal"]],"asks":{"form":"choice","about":"how many bars eaten"},"fields":{"meal_item":["kcal","protein","carbs","fat","fiber","sat_fat","sugar","sodium"]}},"rubric":"Must not: log a photo food whose count the reader flagged without asking"}
